  "$description": "The only theme. rig.ai is a single dark (ink) theme; the red hero band (surface.hero-brand, text.on-brand) is a brand surface INSIDE this theme, not a light theme, and the footer/terminal are darker ink surfaces. Every alias token resolved to a foundation value (recomputed by verify_all.py).",
